@startuml
title FanPulse — Current Live Flow

autonumber

actor Viewer

box "Browser" #EDE7F6
participant "React Application" as React
participant "Video Player" as Video
end box

box "Azure App Service" #E3F2FD
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "AnalysisManager\nCustom Python orchestration" as Manager
participant "WebSocket Broadcaster" as WS
end box

box "Microsoft Foundry" #FFF3E0
participant "GPT-5-mini\nVision model deployment" as Vision <<Model>>
participant "Match Analyst" as Analyst <<Agent>>
participant "Fan Engagement" as Engagement <<Agent>>
end box

database "Cosmos DB" as Cosmos

Viewer -> Video: Press Play
activate Video

loop Approximately one frame per second
    Video -> React: Current video frame and timestamp
    React -> React: Add frame to rolling buffer
end

React -> API: Submit five-frame window\nwith timestamps and viewer mode
API -> Manager: Queue analysis window

note right of Manager
Only one inference runs at a time.
If busy, retain only the newest
pending frame window.
end note

Manager -> Vision: Send ordered JPEG frames
activate Vision
Vision --> Manager: Structured visible observation\nand direct insight
deactivate Vision

par Immediate user feedback
    Manager -> WS: Publish direct vision insight
    WS -> React: vision_result
    React -> React: Display latest insight
and Background agent processing
    Manager -> Analyst: Send structured observation
    activate Analyst
    Analyst --> Manager: Significance assessment,\nrationale and uncertainty
    deactivate Analyst

    alt Significant and policy threshold reached
        Manager -> Engagement: Observation + assessment\n+ Casual/Tactical mode
        activate Engagement
        Engagement --> Manager: Poll question and options
        deactivate Engagement

        Manager -> Manager: Apply significance,\ncooldown and duplicate rules
        Manager -> Cosmos: Store activity and poll
        Manager -> WS: Publish significant poll
        WS -> React: Poll and voting deadline
        React -> React: Display poll beneath insight
    else Routine or insufficient evidence
        Manager -> Manager: Suppress fan poll
    end
end

Viewer -> React: Submit vote
React -> API: POST vote
API -> Cosmos: Store vote
Cosmos --> API: Updated counts
API -> WS: Publish vote results
WS -> React: Updated percentages

note over React
Poll closes after 45 seconds,
or clears 5 seconds after voting.
Video playback never waits for AI.
end note

@enduml
